  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a lost soul, unable to escape the mortal world due to a strong sense of duty, an undying devotion, or a need to complete a task that was of vital importance to the soul during their life. Most phantom eidolons are humanoid with a spectral or ectoplasmic appearance, though some take far stranger forms. Your link with your eidolon prevents them from succumbing to corruption and undeath, and together, you will grow in strength and fulfill your phantom's devotion.</p><p>in strength and fulfill your phantom's devotion.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> occult</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> eidolon, ethereal, phantom</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> Ethereal Plane</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> fist (bludgeoning), tendril (bludgeoning), unarmed attacks shaped like a weapon </p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> Con +3, Int +0, Wis +0, Cha +0</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Medicine, Occultism</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> one common mortal language the eidolon spoke in life</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><p><strong>Eidolon Abilities</strong> Initial @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.V5bcYgKbJTHdOBHI]{dutiful retaliation}; Symbiosis @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.N47g9LDkOdZZdgup]{steadfast devotion}; Transcendence @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.oOBWRXPtYIXWp5Sm]{devotion aura}</p>"
